{#
  An escape route out of the guidance corpus.

  Nineteen of thirty-one guidance pages had no inbound link from outside their own
  collection, so a reader arriving from a search engine had no way to discover that the
  other five collections existed (KI-WEB-SITE-019). The hub fixes discovery downward;
  this fixes it upward, from wherever the reader actually landed.

  Rendered on every page under /guidance/ except the hub itself.
#}
{%- if page.url.startsWith('/guidance/') and page.url != '/guidance/' %}
<p class="text-muted" style="font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"><a href="/guidance/">← All guidance</a></p>
{%- endif %}
